      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Humne HTTP1.1 use kiya then why we send Connection: Keep-alive??\nkyunki may be ho skta hai ki humne jo req send ki wo proxy k through jaaye and ho skta hai wo proxy HTTP1.0 use karti ho",
