      "seed": 98836240,
      "version": 112,
      "versionNonce": 1869462190,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787135078107,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Ye ekdam raw req hai isi format me req server ko bhi milta haii",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Ye ekdam raw req hai isi format me req server ko bhi milta haii",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "V8EwFyG1-J7RLA_lSbNxF",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -71.71448605336518,
      "y": 13307.292877013062,
      "width": 1524.7584228515625,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cOxb",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1784217584,
      "version": 496,
      "versionNonce": 1399000882,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787135078107,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "ye decode karega like \\r\\n mila then wo samj lega ki yaha pr line khtm huyi hai\n\niske ander like hardcoded hai ki pehli line me REQTYPE PATH HTTPVersion ka formate hoga so POST /api/v1/users/signup HTTP1.1 ko interprete kar dega\n\nthen 2nd line se wo based on colon splie karega as key-value pair\n\nthen when it reaches to last line  ....0.0\\r\\n then when it sees in new line there is \\r\\n again then it get that yaha pr hearder khtm ho gaye hai",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "ye decode karega like \\r\\n mila then wo samj lega ki yaha pr line khtm huyi hai\n\niske ander like hardcoded hai ki pehli line me REQTYPE PATH HTTPVersion ka formate hoga so POST /api/v1/users/signup HTTP1.1 ko interprete kar dega\n\nthen 2nd line se wo based on colon splie karega as key-value pair\n\nthen when it reaches to last line  ....0.0\\r\\n then when it sees in new line there is \\r\\n again then it get that yaha pr hearder khtm ho gaye hai",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "tOChgTnOFamYRdu_HodJb",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1103.327208767651,
      "y": 13089.096727727348,
      "width": 475.1395568847656,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cOxc",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 546566416,
      "version": 70,
      "versionNonce": 1400780014,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787135078107,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "HTTP1.1 is text based protocol as we see below",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "HTTP1.1 is text based protocol as we see below",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "78mDO4JGgOxTQIbGynAc2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1103.327209053365,
      "y": 13897.625347870206,
      "width": 1288.178955078125,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cOxd",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1471739888,
      "version": 142,
      "versionNonce": 1381914866,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787135078107,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "So isme issue kya haiye pta chl chuka hoga ki ye har req me pure ko line by line interprete karta hai so resources jyada use hote hai",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "So isme issue kya haiye pta chl chuka hoga ki ye har req me pure ko line by line interprete karta hai so resources jyada use hote hai",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "9chY3EtOPQmVa-kJE2n3D",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1104.725088767651,
      "y": 13993.499620148032,
      "width": 975.5592041015625,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "cOxe",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1262329616,
      "version": 109,
      "versionNonce": 1275422510,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787135078107,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "is problem ko HTTP 2 solve karega so les see how it solves this and why HTTP2 is binary protocol",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "is problem ko HTTP 2 solve karega so les see how it solves this and why HTTP2 is binary protocol",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
